---
---
    <div class="terminal-container">
        <div class="terminal-header">
            <div class="window-controls">
                <span class="control close"></span>
                <span class="control minimize"></span>
                <span class="control maximize"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="terminal-title">root@elaine_lab: ~</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="terminal-content">
            <div class="line">
                <span class="prompt">➜</span> <span class="path">~</span> <span class="command">whoami</span>
            </div>
            <div class="line output-text">
                elaine
            </div>

            <div class="line">
                <span class="prompt">➜</span> <span class="path">~</span> <span class="command">./welcome.sh</span>
            </div>
            
            <div class="output">
                <h1 class="glitch-text" data-text="👋 歡迎">👋 歡迎</h1>
                <p class="typewriter-text">
                    我是一位資訊安全研究員，希望能認識對資安或科技有興趣的朋友，一起交流、學習。
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>


<style>


    .terminal-container {
        width: 100%;
        margin: 0 0 60px 0;
        background: rgba(13, 17, 23, 0.95);
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(74, 246, 38, 0.1); /* Green glow */
        border: 1px solid #30363d;
        font-family: 'Menlo', 'Monaco', 'Courier New', monospace;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 10;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .terminal-header {
        background: #161b22;
        padding: 12px 20px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #30363d;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center; /* Center title */
        position: relative;
    }

    .window-controls {
        display: flex;
        gap: 8px;
        position: absolute;
        left: 20px;
    }

    .control {
        width: 12px;
        height: 12px;
        border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .close { background: #ff5f56; }
    .minimize { background: #ffbd2e; }
    .maximize { background: #27c93f; }

    .terminal-title {
        color: #8b949e;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 500;
    }

    .terminal-content {
        padding: 30px;
        color: #e6edf3;
    }

    .line {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    
    .output-text {
        color: #e6edf3;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        padding-left: 20px;
    }

    .prompt { color: #27c93f; font-weight: bold; }
    .path { color: #58a6ff; font-weight: bold; }
    .command { color: #e6edf3; }

    .output {
        margin: 20px 0 30px 20px;
        border-left: 2px solid #30363d;
        padding-left: 20px;
    }

    .output h1 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    .output p {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #d1d5db;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .cursor-blink {
        width: 10px;
        height: 18px;
        background: #e6edf3;
        animation: blink 1s step-end infinite;
    }

    @keyframes blink {
        50% { opacity: 0; }
    }



    /* Mobile Responsiveness：水平 padding 與 main 一致 (16px)，避免首頁各區塊寬度不一致 */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .hero-wrapper {
            padding: 30px 10px;
        }

        .terminal-content {
            padding: 20px 16px;
        }

        .output h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
        }
    }
</style>
